<title>NETHERLANDS: Olivetti, Digital win ABN order.</title>
<headline>Olivetti, Digital win ABN order.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch units of computer groups Olivetti and Digital Equipment said on Thursday they had won a maintenance and services contract for the automation of ABN AMRO's Dutch network of bank outlets.</p>
<p>&quot;This agreement, which runs until the year 2000, has a value of about 300 million guilders in total,&quot; the two companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>Olivetti and Digital previously also provided ABN AMRO with automation products and services.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
